
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Yesterday I gave the opening talk at CppCon 2024 here in Aurora, CO, USA, on <strong>&#8220;Peering Forward: C++&#8217;s Next Decade.&#8221;</strong> Thanks to the wonderful folks at Bash Films and DigitalMedium pulling out all the stops overnight to edit and post the keynote videos as fast as possible, it&#8217;s already up on YouTube right now, below!</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Special thanks to <strong>Andrei Alexandrescu </strong>for being willing to come on-stage for a mini-panel of the two of us talking about reflection examples and experience in various languages! That was a lot of fun, and I hope you will find it informative.</p>



